I (`issueCount`) | **17** |\n| GitHub Search API (`total_count`) | **17** |\n\n**Total: 17 bug-labeled issues** were both created and closed within December 2024.\n\nNote: 26 bug issues total are closed, but only 17 of those were closed *during* December 2024 itself. The remaining 9 closed bug issues were closed after December 2024.\n\n### Summary\n\n| Metric | Count |\n|---|---|\n| Total issues created in Dec 2024 | **61** |\n| Bug-labeled issues created in Dec 2024 | **28** |\n| Bug-labeled issues created AND closed in Dec 2024 | **17** |"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":15579,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":397,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXtFQE7rz7Yc3JmPJoTKo","type":"assistant","uuid":"6cb4e202-7b06-4cde-b00d-b7298b9ac4b8","timestamp":"2026-02-07T06:39:05.605Z"}
